.TH KONVERT 1 "2026-11-12" "konvert 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
konvert \- fast, offline file converter and optimizer for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B konvert
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B konvert
converts images, video, audio and documents locally, without uploading files.
It is usually invoked from the Dolphin/Nautilus/Nemo/Thunar context menu or the
.B konvert-settings
GUI.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-target " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Target format (webp, png, jpg, jxl, avif, mp4, mkv, webm, gif, mp3, wav, pdf, txt, ...).
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quality " " \fI1\-100\fR
Lossy quality for images.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-lossless
Lossless mode (images and video).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Overwrite existing outputs instead of creating \fIname_2.ext\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-backup
Create a \fI.bak\fR backup copy before overwriting an existing file.
.TP
.BR \-\-dry\-run
Preview output destinations and planned conversions without modifying files.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-recursive
Recursively scan directories for input files.
.TP
.BR \-\-profile " " \fINAME\fR
Apply a preset profile (\fBweb\fR, \fBbalanced\fR, \fBarchive\fR, \fBlossless\fR, or custom).
.TP
.BR \-\-list\-profiles
List all available preset profiles.
.TP
.BR \-\-save\-profile " " \fINAME\fR
Save current CLI settings as a named preset profile in configuration.
.TP
.BR \-\-check\-update
Check GitHub releases for available software updates.
.TP
.BR \-\-completions " " \fISHELL\fR
Generate shell completions (\fBbash\fR, \fBzsh\fR, or \fBfish\fR).
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-jobs " " \fIN\fR
Maximum parallel conversions (1\-64, default: CPU cores capped at 4).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output\-dir " " \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default: input file's directory).
.TP
.BR \-\-target\-size " " \fISIZE\fR
Compress toward a size limit, e.g. \fB8mb\fR, \fB25mb\fR, \fB1.5gb\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-merge\-pdf
Merge the given images into a single PDF.
.TP
.BR \-\-strip\-metadata
Remove EXIF/GPS metadata (images, video, audio).
.TP
.BR \-\-resize " " \fISPEC\fR
Resize images: \fB50%\fR, \fB30\fR, \fB1080p\fR, \fB720p\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-extract\-frames
Extract one PNG frame per second into \fI<name>_frames/\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-gif\-duration " " \fISECONDS\fR
GIF length; \fB0\fR means the whole video (default: 15).
.TP
.BR \-\-gif\-fps " " \fIFPS\fR
GIF frame rate (1\-60, default: 15).
.TP
.BR \-\-max\-pages " " \fIN\fR
Maximum pages rendered from a PDF (0 = unlimited, default: 200).
.TP
.BR \-\-crf " " \fI0\-51\fR
Video CRF value.
.TP
.BR \-\-preset " " \fINAME\fR
x264 preset (ultrafast ... veryslow).
.TP
.BR \-\-bitrate " " \fIRATE\fR
Audio bitrate, e.g. \fB192k\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-dpi " " \fIN\fR
PDF rendering DPI (36\-1200, default: 300).
.TP
.B \-\-cancel
Stop the running conversion (validated by PID; kills the process group).
.TP
.B \-\-check\-deps
Report whether ffmpeg, ImageMagick, ghostscript, poppler, LibreOffice,
cjxl/djxl are available.
.TP
.B \-\-install\-all
Install context menus for Dolphin, Nautilus, Nemo and Thunar.
.TP
.B \-\-uninstall\-all
Remove all installed context menus.
.TP
.B \-\-sync\-menu
Regenerate the Dolphin service menus from the config.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-settings
Open the Qt6 settings GUI.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
konvert \-t webp photo.png
konvert \-t mp4 \-\-target\-size 8mb video.mov
konvert \-\-merge\-pdf page1.png page2.png
konvert \-t mp3 video.mp4
cat photo.jpg | konvert \-t webp \- > photo.webp
konvert \-\-check\-deps
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/konvert/config.toml
User configuration (created on first run).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/konvert/history.json
Last 100 conversions.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/konvert/running.pid
PID of the active conversion, used by \fB\-\-cancel\fR.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on conversion/installation failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR magick (1),
.BR gs (1)
